---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Frequently Asked Questions">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <h2>Do I need to download an app?</h2>
    <p>No, we are a web-first application. You can use our tools directly from your browser.</p>
    <h2>Are the calculators accurate?</h2>
    <p>Our calculators are based on established scientific literature and guidelines, but they provide baselines and estimates, not medical advice.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
